  "description": "The Teammachine 01 AMP TWO takes everything you know about a BMC road bike and turns it up to 160%. With the highest 01 Premium Carbon layup, it stays feather-light yet razor-sharp under power. Add 200 watts of pedal assist from the TQ-HPR40 motor system, seamlessly integrated, and you’ve got pro-level support that feels like your best day ever – every day.\nRide feel and handling remain unmistakably Teammachine: precise, confident, and fast. Targeted Tuned Compliance Concept Race smooths rough roads while keeping your momentum locked in.\nIntegration is clean and minimal, including discreet Shimano hood control for effortless management of your extra power with a Shimano Ultegra Di2 drivetrain ensuring smooth shifting and braking. The BMC ICS Carbon Evo cockpit gives a clean, aero front, while CR 40 Carbon tubeless-ready 40mm wheels roll fast and smooth.",
